const FEATURE_FLAG = getFlag('checkoutRedesign');
if (FEATURE_FLAG && isMobileUser()) {
  showNewCheckout();
} else {
  showOldCheckout();
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you design rollback instrumentation to ensure rapid detection?
- How would you communicate risk trade-offs to leadership without slowing progress?

## Why This Is Asked

This question probes advanced negotiation, mediation, and feedback skills across multiple stakeholders in high-stakes product launches.

## Key Concepts

- Negotiation dynamics across functions
- Mediation steps and facilitation
- Structured feedback and action plans

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode: mediation plan generator
function mediationPlan(stakeholders, constraints){
  const goals = intersect(stakeholders.map(s => s.goals));
  const options = brainstorm(stakeholders, constraints);
  const chosen = selectOptions(options, goals, constraints);
  return { goals, options, chosen, feedback: {} };
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you measure success in this scenario?
- How would you ensure post-implementation feedback is incorporated?
